msgid "Global options (``--session``, ``--timeout``) go before the command. ``session serve`` stays in the foreground for supervisors; ``session start`` returns after a background host registers. ``session stop`` refuses unsaved changes and active exports. Use ``--discard`` only to intentionally discard unsaved edits."
