#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:285
msgid "Results are JSON on stdout, except the default text timeline view. Errors are JSON on stderr with exit status 1; argument-parser errors exit 2. Mutations return compact summaries with an ``inspect`` command. ``get`` returns native object JSON. Project replies include a revision; effect catalog replies do not require a session. Logs from headless sessions live beside their registry records. ``OPENSHOT_SESSION_DIR`` overrides the default ``~/.openshot_qt/sessions`` directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:292
msgid "Sessions accept commands locally on your computer. Keep the session registry private, since it contains the credentials used to access your editing sessions. Exports work from a snapshot, so you can continue editing while a job runs."
msgstr ""

